<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices.</p>
<p>					Oct 14/Oct 11  Oct 14/Dec 31, 95</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
